  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7c/Mavis.png/revision/latest?cb=20260719101721\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mavis\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"291\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Mavis</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-characters-29468\" title=\"Category:Characters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">non-player character</a> (NPC) who guides players through the first levels of the game. Previously, this task belonged to the scarecrow (until end of 2025). Mavis first appeared in the game Hay Day Pop as Greg's girlfriend. Then she appeared in Squadbusters before arriving in Hay Day.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Tutorial</b></span></h3>\n<p>Players meet Mavis on their farms right at the start of the game. She walks them trough the most essential features of the game, such as cultivating <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crops</a>, making <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, and collecting <a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animal goods</a>.\n</p><p>Until the end of 2025, this tutorial was done by Mr. Wicker, a talking scarecrow. Despite that, he still appears in the other tutorials.\n</p><p>Here are some highlights from the tutorial by Mavis:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AStart_Tutorial_1.jpg\" title=\"Start Tutorial 1.jpg (268 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/ac/Start_Tutorial_1.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20260719105900\" title=\"Start Tutorial 1.jpg (268 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Start Tutorial 1.jpg (268 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AStart_Tutorial_2.jpg\" title=\"Start Tutorial 2.jpg (537 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/86/Start_Tutorial_2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20260719110001\" title=\"Start Tutorial 2.jpg (537 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Start Tutorial 2.jpg (537 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AStart_Tutorial_End_1.jpg\" title=\"Start Tutorial End 1.jpg (275 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0a/Start_Tutorial_End_1.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20260719110102\" title=\"Start Tutorial End 1.jpg (275 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Start Tutorial End 1.jpg (275 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AStart_Tutorial_End_2.jpg\" title=\"Start Tutorial End 2.jpg (305 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/12/Start_Tutorial_End_2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20260719110147\" title=\"Start Tutorial End 2.jpg (305 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Start Tutorial End 2.jpg (305 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831195622\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 56/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5119/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.763      1 Template:Clr\n100.00%    1.763      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36756-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831195622 and revision id 110772. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
